    "top_frame": "Trevor McDonald lasted four innings, which means the bullpen owned this game from the start. JT Brubaker threw 2.1 scoreless. Dylan Smith and Jason Foley stayed clean. The offense produced six hits and eight strikeouts. Willy Adames tied it in the ninth with a home run. Kansas City won it anyway, 4\u20133.",
